   "fix": "Route dep candidates through the shared rule: drop any `sha` for which `bump_moves.dependency_move(self.src.compare(repo, pin, sha)[0], on_branch)` returns no kind (the compares are already memoised in `GitHub.compare`), so mathlib and the other direct dependencies are both filtered by `bump_moves`.",
